    "# COLISEUM Defender — Notebook 2: SFT Training (Distillation)\n",
    "## Aditya's Part | Pre-Hackathon (Run on Kaggle — Thu night)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Fine-tune Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct using knowledge distillation from LlamaGuard teacher labels.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Kaggle Setup:**\n",
    "- Accelerator: **GPU T4 x1** (single T4 — NOT T4 x2, that's 5x slower)\n",
    "- Internet: ON\n",
    "- Expected runtime: ~45-60 minutes\n",
    "- Session budget: ~1 hour of your 30h/week quota\n",
    "\n",
    "**Input:** `coliseum-defender-dataset` (from Notebook 1, pushed to HF)\n",
    "**Output:** `coliseum-defender-sft` checkpoint → pushed to HF Hub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
